+#pragma once
+
+// SR-Source Net Plus: the windows of Online/LAN play in the launcher (launcher_online.hpp): the one
+// that asks HOST or CONNECT, and the room (the lobby) where the players gather and the host sets the
+// race. Drawn from plain data, with the launcher's look and the Netplay lobby's pieces
